            "name": "Jay R. Monroe",
            "bio": "<p>Jay Monroe was a co-founder of Monroe Systems for Business. With a background in accounting, before starting Monroe, he was employed at Western Electric Company as a general chief clerk. Mr. Monroe was also the president of two subsidiaries, the Gardner Company, an adding machine manufacturer, and the Defiance Manufacturing Company, a check-writing machine manufacturer.</p>"
